  "headline": "This repo built the tool-result contract the spine asks for. It has nine typed failure categories, a 256 KiB cap, a truncated flag, and a doc comment naming the incidents inbox as its consumer. Its audit table has held zero rows since it was created on 2026-03-12 — measured in the pre-purge backup, not the emptied live file.",
